_index":9},{"dia_id":"D22:10","global_turn_index":379,"locator":"[S22T10]","raw_turn_sha256":"8ceac6480a8d64c10dd54ad6f0a9424f60e058b7a04f39ff603222ee1aa531b3","rendered_turn_sha256":"9bffc1c6960c9003abe55d5c3cbbc972faee8839562b230a639d79afa8502113","session_date":"2023-10-08","session_datetime":"2023-10-08T15:13:00","session_id":"session_22","session_index":22,"source_sha256":"e2895d4975a100b9a979970354f273696d4406f57ab408617b4c2b9dd50a88e1","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":10}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin! What’s up? Last Friday I went to the car show. I saw some awesome cars and got to mess with car mods! There were so many cool machines around, it was so much fun! Take a look at this beautiful car!\n[Image caption: a photography of two men looking at a car engine]\n[S22T1] (dia_id: D22:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, that sounds awesome! I'm into the rush of awesome cars. Can't wait to check out your garage.\n[Image caption: a photo of a red sports car parked in a showroom]\n[S22T2] (dia_id: D22:2)\n\nDave: Thanks! Yeah, this one looks great! I restored and modified it myself and added a custom exhaust and some performance upgrades. It's got a sweet sound and I'm really proud of how it turned out.\n[S22T3] (dia_id: D22:3)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! You really turned it into a masterpiece. Impressive!\n[Image caption: a photo of a car driving down a street with a traffic light]\n[S22T4] (dia_id: D22:4)\n\nDave: Thanks Calvin! I've spent a lot of time and effort on it. It's not just a hobby, it's a passion. It's like therapy, a way to get away from everyday stress. When I was little I'd spend hours in my dad's garage, tinkering with engines - it was like my own sanctuary. Now I'm lucky enough to do this as a job, to take something broken and make it into something awesome.\n[S22T5] (dia_id: D22:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave, that's amazing. Bringing broken things back to life is so satisfying. Working on cars can be a real escape from reality, and I understand that feeling. Doing what you love for a living, that's the ultimate goal, right? Keep going with it, it's really inspiring.\n[S22T6] (dia_id: D22:6)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin. It's been my goal since I was a kid and it's awesome to be able to do something I love. Restoring things like this can be tough but the feeling of accomplishment it gives is great. Absolutely, I'm loving it.\n[S22T7] (dia_id: D22:7)\n\nCalvin: Go for it, Dave! Chasing your dreams is what life's about. It's awesome to see how far you've come. Keep working hard and living your best life.\n[S22T8] (dia_id: D22:8)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Means a lot. I'm going to keep chasing my dreams and working hard. Conversations like this remind me why I love what I do.\n[S22T9] (dia_id: D22:9)\n\nCalvin: Glad I can remind you, Dave. Keep up the good work and stay focused. You got this!\n[S22T10] (dia_id: D22:10)","text_sha256":"0b7dfe6467538e16b6d3bca9cf901aa156f58ab2db4a4746cc5d9cb4ffaec477","timestamp":"2023-10-08T15:13:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D4:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":21,"line_start":20,"source_locators":["[S4T3]"],"text_sha256":"1d4102de571f05e48d7679b48f6da35e9e0d98ddc2b7208cad8982da9b011d84"},{"dia_ids":["D4:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":25,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S4T4]"],"text_sha256":"5191eaa853bb06f4ea440920a498dcfecc2648b5d621eafac58f715b5729f6ee"},{"dia_ids":["D4:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S4T5]"],"text_sha256":"558c132154b911dff23c78b11d023c6b89685b1b5e2f3a7215ba2cab85b5d7ae"},{"dia_ids":["D4:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":32,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S4T6]"],"text_sha256":"e472be1b48305feec6f5e2cd042b0bf8748abec8b718542ec46062aeeee2d75e"},{"dia_ids":["D4:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":36,"line_start":34,"sour