:"D4:12","global_turn_index":70,"locator":"[S4T12]","raw_turn_sha256":"2029df95f1b43b3533c2dc09d5696de881409e2faa21c78b928d07af83c39597","rendered_turn_sha256":"28ea29b9d1a14fa7cca89b909af05dfedcc945e6a8d84cf0e7f1f03205389f78","session_date":"2023-05-01","session_datetime":"2023-05-01T18:24:00","session_id":"session_4","session_index":4,"source_sha256":"91f17581ccd8dcef52d1821ace4a2d5265d3c3ac8be04b9d12875f6ca76e5823","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":12}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Thanks, Cal! It's great to see my hard work paying off. Opening this shop was my dream, and I'm really happy to see it getting started. It was a lot of hard work, but it was worth it.\n[S4T3] (dia_id: D4:3)\n\nCalvin: Woo, Dave! Congrats on achieving your dream - you've got guts and ambition - that's awesome! Keep it up!\n[Image caption: a photo of a book with a space theme on it]\n[S4T4] (dia_id: D4:4)\n\nDave: Thanks! Appreciate the support. My dream was to open a shop and it's a step towards my other dream of working on classic cars. I love their design and engineering.\n[S4T5] (dia_id: D4:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! Going for it with classic cars is cool! Fulfilling your dreams is so important.\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car parked in a parking lot]\n[S4T6] (dia_id: D4:6)\n\nDave: I'm obsessed with classic cars. They have a unique charm. I was so thrilled to restore one last year—nothing like bringing it back to life! Take a look at the engine of the restored car.\n[Image caption: a photo of a car engine with a small air filter]\n[S4T7] (dia_id: D4:7)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! That looks awesome!\n[S4T8] (dia_id: D4:8)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It was a labor of love. Challenging, but so worth it.\n[S4T9] (dia_id: D4:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's awesome when you see something you worked on come to life.\n[S4T10] (dia_id: D4:10)\n\nDave: Yeah! It feels great to see the hard work pay off, it's like bringing something back to life.\n[S4T11] (dia_id: D4:11)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's an amazing feeling when you create something and it resonates with people. It's so satisfying when you finish something you made from scratch!\n[S4T12] (dia_id: D4:12)","text_sha256":"2c9f6e62df5f54f41c1f69d9fbcbce423be3cc80649eacf014e21d7e4879c2c2","timestamp":"2023-05-01T18:24:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D5:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":14,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S5T1]"],"text_sha256":"9c915f2f720758f1aa69f85fb7031406f5a908a381aee36bcf2d23718843c282"},{"dia_ids":["D5:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":18,"line_start":16,"source_locators":["[S5T2]"],"text_sha256":"336332abff03e5f7b2a1fe35516f1bfe526ca19cb7a38eeeff144ca466d52b46"},{"dia_ids":["D5:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":20,"source_locators":["[S5T3]"],"text_sha256":"a25cd32818a9be4a8398a4723f9944448d406631a9818161bf7b4c014fd2adec"},{"dia_ids":["D5:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":25,"line_start":24,"source_locators":["[S5T4]"],"text_sha256":"4b88c4089b91f031a19b310c2dbc5b0d5c438403f60587ccdf81181213a4148a"},{"dia_ids":["D5:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S5T5]"],"text_sha256":"95b51e9c382d11641d8cc39f743c473a109b3611538ef8967014388813d1f795"},{"dia_ids":["D5:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":31,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S5T6]"],"text_sha256":"3ae0549b4a037d2cc7f3b387de0c13b3248bd962659b9ff1d5c503cadc2a37e1"},{"dia_ids":["D5:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":34,"line_start":33,"source_locators":["[S5T7]"],"text_sha256":"acf74ea4919bd10706c4f4cd07128cc50f6dd7f3c90935b6b9405a7307a81912"},{"dia_ids":["D5:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":38,"line_start":36,"source_locators":["[S5T8]"],"text_sha256":"496922821f4c583eba942ea291d4ab7c654af909b6cb9ccd56156da226e215fb"}],"dia_ids":["D5:1","D5:2","D5:3","D5:4","D5:5","D5:6","D5:7","D5:8"],"evi