a256":"e4246246c4a179221a169e4150691d930b8b8372b2e96cfda603ae2545ad2840","rendered_turn_sha256":"496922821f4c583eba942ea291d4ab7c654af909b6cb9ccd56156da226e215fb","session_date":"2023-05-03","session_datetime":"2023-05-03T13:16:00","session_id":"session_5","session_index":5,"source_sha256":"6737cf885d4e464a4bc7cdc247741c1bccc31c9837102bae693df38480b7f050","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":8}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin! Long time no talk. How's it going? Crazy news - I'm teaming up with a local garage. Take a look at what we working on together!\n[Image caption: a photo of a car being worked on in a garage]\n[S5T1] (dia_id: D5:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, great to hear from you! That's awesome news about teaming up with a local garage. Super inspiring seeing you follow your passion. Congratulations on this new venture. It's impressive how far you've come since we last chatted. How's everything going?\n[Image caption: a photo of a green car in a garage with a sign in the background]\n[S5T2] (dia_id: D5:2)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I'm loving this job. I get to work with awesome mechanics and share my knowledge about cars. Here's what I'm currently working on! It's a cool project, even if it's a bit challenging. 🤩\n[Image caption: a photography of a man working on a car engine in a garage]\n[S5T3] (dia_id: D5:3)\n\nCalvin: That car looks awesome! You're putting in a lot of effort and it's great to see the end result. Keep up the good work. Got any plans for what's next?\n[S5T4] (dia_id: D5:4)\n\nDave: Thanks Calvin! Appreciate the support. I'm gonna keep learning more about auto engineering, maybe even build a custom car from scratch someday - that's the dream! For now, just gonna keep working on this project and assisting customers.\n[S5T5] (dia_id: D5:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! You're so inspiring - good for you for pushing yourself to achieve your dream. Making a custom car sounds awesome. Don't forget to relax and enjoy the process too!\n[S5T6] (dia_id: D5:6)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Gotta take time to chill. Do you have any hobbies that help you relax?\n[S5T7] (dia_id: D5:7)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, long drives in [this car] really help me relax. The feeling of the wind and the open road is so freeing. It helps me clear my head. What do you like to do to chill out? \n[Image caption: a photo of a red sports car driving down a road]\n[S5T8] (dia_id: D5:8)","text_sha256":"141c2352134732b841104f1398cf53c1c3c6e42c7dbea43aa8871ac364e43528","timestamp":"2023-05-03T13:16:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D7:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S7T1]"],"text_sha256":"012ef9f23f3b50cf765546b114b2598fa9313302d6957a0530e0d6200c696707"},{"dia_ids":["D7:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":17,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S7T2]"],"text_sha256":"f4d9526e0fe3720c91774051474d662a5e70fc3c640cac71c149a10664204d75"},{"dia_ids":["D7:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":20,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S7T3]"],"text_sha256":"e21ffc108c8713e25b3b276ac6c93d0b3990c3805e72d5dfbf5bfe0854f8bb74"},{"dia_ids":["D7:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":23,"line_start":22,"source_locators":["[S7T4]"],"text_sha256":"29c7f28da678631cc2445278145c32a97ca12fe948d970f5a30e37ee09cfe88f"},{"dia_ids":["D7:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":26,"line_start":25,"source_locators":["[S7T5]"],"text_sha256":"d7d258d076f2897c721539dad49d239bdbf2f2659388a05628a31891a6e47e86"},{"dia_ids":["D7:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":29,"line_start":28,"source_locators":["[S7T6]"],"text_sha256":"46a043b0767915bb66b8266ea1bc651d4f401f573fc11b4560bb60bc73602264"}],"dia_ids":["D7:1","D7:2","D7:3","D7:4","D7:5","D7:6"],"evidence_id":"ev-c81b0f10e405f42dac96ecc212614fc31b4cf454824ff64ae683736829b84506","group_id":"session_7","line_end":29,"line_start"